omx-dsp (0.25.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * ci: omx-dsp-devel's expected files name
    /usr/share/omxdsp/hrp_peaking_corpus.h, which the twins commit installs
    (#218, #1823)
  * install: the golden HRP peaking corpus ships under datadir/omxdsp, named
    by omxdsp.pc's hrpcorpus, so a consumer's twin test reads this copy
  * ci: publish.yml packs and publishes ts/ to npm on a version tag, a dry
    run on dispatch
  * ts: @openmixer/omx-dsp, the TypeScript twins of the unit, octave-Q and
    RTA-size kernels, each pinned by an agreement test
  * Version 0.25.0: built against omx-contract 3.0.0, floor >= 3.0.0 (#218)
  * omx_eq_defaults.h: the default EQ rule arrives from omx-contract, its
    oracle beside it (#218)
  * contract.d/3: data/ installs under schema major 3, c.alias out
    (non-verbatim) (#218)

